Package: surveyIDmasker
Title: Mask Participant Identifiers in Survey Exports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Francesco", "Zanibellato", email = "fz150@georgetown.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Replaces participant identifiers in survey exports (Prolific,
    CloudResearch Connect and MTurk IDs, IP addresses, locations, emails)
    with codes prefixed by "MSK", made by encrypting each value with a private
    key. Data can be shared without disclosing identities while repeated
    participants remain recognizable, and the authors, who keep the key, can
    turn the codes back into the original identifiers. Reads and writes the
    CSV, SPSS (.sav) and Excel (.xlsx) files exported by Qualtrics.
